@startuml
' 系统顺序图 — 发牌流程 (SSD - Deal Cards)

actor "Game Host" as Host

box "System" #LightBlue
  participant "GameController" as Ctrl
  participant "GameEngine" as Engine
  participant "DealManager" as Deal
  participant "TurnManager" as Turn
  participant "EventBus" as EB
end box

Host -> Ctrl: startNewGame()
Ctrl -> Engine: initializeGame(players, ruleConfig)
Engine -> Engine: 创建 GameState + RuleEngine

Engine -> Deal: dealCards(gameState)
Deal -> Deal: 生成52张牌 (4花色 x 13点数)
Deal -> Deal: Collections.shuffle(deck)
Deal -> Deal: 分配4人各13张
Deal -> Deal: 识别持有♦3的玩家 → openingPlayer
Deal --> Engine: gameState 已填充手牌

Engine -> Engine: setOpeningTurn(true)
Engine -> Turn: switchPlayer(gameState)
Turn -> EB: post(TurnChangedEvent(openingPlayer, GAME_START))

Engine --> Ctrl: 发牌完成
Ctrl --> Host: GameViewData (手牌 + 回合信息)

@enduml
